## Why This Is Asked

Assess the ability to design a robust, runtime-extensible CLI plugin architecture with clear isolation, DI, and safety guarantees.

## Key Concepts

- Plugin registry and dynamic loading
- Execution isolation (workers or sandboxes)
- Per-command timeouts and structured events
- Dependency injection for commands

## Code Example

